      "role": "user",
      "content": "Sometimes i just stand in the middle of the subway station during rush hour and it hits me how easy it would be to just... not be here anymore. Like, everyone is just a blur of motion. I could just stop existing and the crowd would just flow around the empty space where i was and nobody would even blink. it feels so real.",
